WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:04.164
Two simple ways to a first conversation with Giannis Farazis:

2
00:00:04.409 --> 00:00:07.752
book an appointment yourself, or ask him to call you.

3
00:00:08.852 --> 00:00:11.940
To book, you choose a topic, a way to meet,

4
00:00:11.940 --> 00:00:14.250
a day and a time from the real free times.

5
00:00:14.552 --> 00:00:17.628
You receive an e-mail at once that the request was received,

6
00:00:17.722 --> 00:00:19.185
and once it is confirmed,

7
00:00:19.185 --> 00:00:23.259
an e-mail with every detail and a reminder the day before.

8
00:00:24.359 --> 00:00:26.529
Or, with no message and no e-mail:

9
00:00:26.994 --> 00:00:31.127
you leave your name, phone number, the topic and when suits you,

10
00:00:31.220 --> 00:00:35.608
morning, midday or afternoon, and he calls you.

11
00:00:36.708 --> 00:00:39.923
Either way, the first conversation commits you to nothing.

12
00:00:41.023 --> 00:00:43.332
For a first conversation with no commitment,

13
00:00:43.333 --> 00:00:46.769
call plus three five seven, nine seven, eight four zero,

14
00:00:46.828 --> 00:00:49.764
nine four one, or send a WhatsApp message.
